        "created_at": "2013-02-26T12:28:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't have my cards in front of me so I can't give specific examples, but I keep seeing cards that state \"Destroy this card.\"&nbsp; Now I understand that doesn't mean literally destroy the cards.&nbsp; My question is, does it mean put the card back in the game box not to be used for the rest of that game?&nbsp; Or is the card placed in your trash to be reshuffled into your deck later?</p>",
